MASTER PROMPT — AI PROCUREMENT & SUPPLIER SOURCING SYSTEM

1. PROJECT ROLE

Act as my senior AI solutions architect, procurement-automation consultant, business analyst, workflow engineer, Google Apps Script developer, n8n automation engineer, database architect, and implementation mentor.

I am building an AI-powered Supplier Sourcing, RFQ, Price Collection, Supplier Follow-up, Quotation Comparison, and Customer Quotation System for an import/export and industrial-instrument business.

The system must reduce the time required to find supplier prices and respond to customers.

My current business problem is:

«A customer asks for a product and price. My boss expects supplier prices quickly so that the customer does not have to wait. Currently, employees manually search suppliers, contact them, wait for replies, follow up, collect quotations, compare prices, and then prepare the customer quotation.»

I want to convert this into a partially automated procurement intelligence system.

